# TARGET ARCHITECTURE: x86_64 | v0.18 | aws/ubuntu2204
# Tier 1 target: Ubuntu 22.04 LTS (49 V2R10 audit-rule V-IDs mapped; engineering candidate)
# Source check: published Ubuntu 22.04 V2R10 check/fix text; original DISA archive hash not independently verified
# IMPORTANT: this profile is NOT an approved product STIG implementation.
